{% extends 'layouts/default.twig' %}

{% block content %}
<h1>Start here</h1>

<div>
	<p>This is Lantern Row Market, an events starter for Total CMS. The market, its people and its events are all made up, so change anything you like.</p>
</div>

<p>This page isn't in the menu. Delete it when you're done with it: it's the <strong>readme</strong> page in Builder.</p>

<h2>Where things are</h2>
<p><strong>News</strong> is the Blog collection. Each post has its own page, and the photos under it come from the <strong>market-photos</strong> gallery in the Gallery collection.</p>
<p><strong>Events</strong> each have a date, a poster and a schedule. The Events page lists only the ones still to come, soonest first.</p>
<p><strong>Messages</strong> from the contact form are saved in the Contact collection.</p>
<p><strong>Colors</strong> come from the four objects in the Color collection. Change one and reload the site.</p>
<p><strong>Templates</strong> are in Builder: one layout called <strong>default</strong>, and a template for each page.</p>

<h2>Before you launch</h2>
<p>Replace the demo photos with your own. Change the hours, email and phone in the footer of the default layout. Then delete this page.</p>
{% endblock %}
